# For more info on HTTP files go to https://aka.ms/vs/httpfile

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7145

### CREATE TASK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Build My First Backend API",
    "description": "Develop a task management system using ASP.NET Core",
    "isCompleted": false
}

### GET ALL TASKS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Tasks

### GET TASK BY ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Tasks/1

### UPDATE TASK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": 1,
    "title": "Build My First Backend API",
    "description": "Successfully developed and tested my API",
    "isCompleted": true
}

### DELETE TASK
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Tasks/1
